WEBVTT

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>Palais Natura, the castle of King Arthur,</i>

00:00:12.110 --> 00:00:16.690
<i>had an imposing aura that
 promised world domination.</i>

00:00:16.690 --> 00:00:18.730
<i>The people could only but tremble in fear</i>

00:00:18.730 --> 00:00:20.850
<i>and pray to the gods.</i>

00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:29.860
<i>The elites of the West
 were going forth into battle.</i>

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:38.870
<i>The fate of the East seemed 
more precarious than ever.</i>

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:49.860
Both sides, retreat!

00:00:50.340 --> 00:00:52.710
As a representative of the West,

00:00:52.710 --> 00:00:56.730
I would like to propose 
peace to Oda Nobunaga!

00:02:36.570 --> 00:02:38.920
It's been a while, Destroyer-King.

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:41.320
No, Oda Nobunaga.

00:02:43.090 --> 00:02:46.600
Let's hear what your true intentions are.

00:02:46.760 --> 00:02:48.130
True intentions?

00:02:48.930 --> 00:02:52.100
I only spoke truth.

00:02:52.470 --> 00:02:54.110
The Caesar I knew would

00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:56.910
not have desired peace 
between the East and West.

00:02:57.270 --> 00:03:01.350
Perhaps I should say
 that I have been awakened.

00:03:03.440 --> 00:03:05.950
I faced King Arthur once more,

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:08.120
and saw for myself where he desires to go.

00:03:08.530 --> 00:03:09.410
Is that so?

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:13.240
King Arthur wishes to bring
 salvation and prosperity to both stars.

00:03:13.240 --> 00:03:15.490
He is a man capable of that feat.

00:03:16.140 --> 00:03:17.850
He wishes to create a new world

00:03:17.850 --> 00:03:20.000
where everyone helps one another and has

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:21.850
equal opportunity to attain happiness.

00:03:23.070 --> 00:03:24.040
Caesar...

00:03:24.510 --> 00:03:26.000
You've changed.

00:03:29.440 --> 00:03:30.910
You have, as well.

00:03:33.590 --> 00:03:37.470
I've been thinking that I need to 
repay you for that tea ceremony.

00:03:39.130 --> 00:03:42.110
Let us work together, Oda Nobunaga.

00:03:42.110 --> 00:03:43.790
We can reach an understanding.

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:56.400
I'd rather lick pine sap 
than go through with this.

00:03:58.490 --> 00:04:00.040
So that's your answer.

00:04:01.730 --> 00:04:03.040
Hey, Nobu!

00:04:03.260 --> 00:04:04.200
Wait!

00:04:04.200 --> 00:04:05.270
Nobunaga...

00:04:08.160 --> 00:04:11.070
Sorry, can you go?

00:04:11.070 --> 00:04:12.810
You're with the enemy now.

00:04:13.370 --> 00:04:15.980
I won't stab you in the back,

00:04:15.980 --> 00:04:17.540
but if you do happen to show up

00:04:17.540 --> 00:04:19.610
in front of me, I won't hold back.

00:04:21.750 --> 00:04:23.060
It's unfortunate.

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:30.710
Be vigilant with the maintenance.

00:04:30.710 --> 00:04:35.130
It seems I can only entrust my 
life to my sword and this armor.

00:04:35.130 --> 00:04:36.570
Of course we will.

00:04:36.950 --> 00:04:38.630
Let us handle it.

00:04:39.050 --> 00:04:40.080
Nobunaga,

00:04:40.080 --> 00:04:41.850
what are you doing here, of all places?

00:04:42.310 --> 00:04:46.080
Harsh words for my workplace.

00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:48.850
You should get Orléans checked out, as well.

00:04:49.250 --> 00:04:51.160
We may have to sortie at any moment.

00:04:51.450 --> 00:04:52.620
Why?

00:04:53.490 --> 00:04:56.560
Why did you reject peace 
before even hearing him out?

00:04:56.560 --> 00:04:59.360
Dismissing Caesar out of hand like that is...

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:02.640
I have no intention of changing my decision.

00:05:02.640 --> 00:05:05.980
There is no other path but
 to sever ties with Caesar now.

00:05:06.800 --> 00:05:10.040
But that's as if you want war!

00:05:10.840 --> 00:05:14.610
As if you're admitting that 
you are the Destroyer-King.

00:05:15.110 --> 00:05:16.670
Me, the Destroyer-King?

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:18.760
Suppose I am, then what?

00:05:18.760 --> 00:05:19.510
What?

00:05:19.510 --> 00:05:21.040
I'm just following my own path.

00:05:21.400 --> 00:05:23.390
You should choose your own path, too.

00:05:23.720 --> 00:05:24.490
That's all.

00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:30.950
My own path...

00:05:33.150 --> 00:05:35.400
What are you planning, Caesar?

00:05:35.650 --> 00:05:38.280
Destruction and emptiness 
awaits at the end of war.

00:05:38.870 --> 00:05:41.320
I just ceased to find meaning in that.

00:05:42.130 --> 00:05:43.660
That's all.

00:05:43.660 --> 00:05:44.910
What's your point?

00:05:45.210 --> 00:05:47.370
It is King Arthur's desire to have peace.

00:05:47.930 --> 00:05:51.100
I can tolerate your
 dissatisfaction on that point, however.

00:05:51.100 --> 00:05:52.540
Surely, you jest.

00:05:52.540 --> 00:05:55.650
King Arthur would never say such a thing.

00:05:55.650 --> 00:05:57.110
It is true.

00:05:57.110 --> 00:05:59.990
He desires true peace.

00:06:01.240 --> 00:06:04.690
King Arthur is an infinite 
darkness that engulfs all.

00:06:04.690 --> 00:06:09.010
His darkness destroys any who
 would dare to defy or oppose him!

00:06:09.010 --> 00:06:10.870
That is his true self.

00:06:11.810 --> 00:06:14.310
Now you claim he desires peace?

00:06:14.310 --> 00:06:15.920
Impossible.

00:06:15.920 --> 00:06:17.390
Caesar, you are simply a fool

00:06:17.390 --> 00:06:20.440
who does not understand His Majesty's will.

00:06:22.590 --> 00:06:25.470
It is you who have misunderstood.

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:28.950
His Majesty is light itself.

00:06:29.410 --> 00:06:30.800
Light?

00:06:30.800 --> 00:06:33.640
His divine beauty...

00:06:33.640 --> 00:06:36.060
Now that I understand his true intentions,

00:06:36.060 --> 00:06:37.760
I have realized that my destiny

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:43.970
is to bring his light anywhere 
it has not yet reached.

00:06:46.500 --> 00:06:48.970
That is why I am here.

00:06:49.590 --> 00:06:50.970
You...

00:06:51.470 --> 00:06:56.540
You made the Perfecta by applying 
the technology da Vinci left behind.

00:06:57.010 --> 00:06:59.480
You should use that for our goals, as well.

00:07:00.140 --> 00:07:01.480
How did you...

00:07:01.710 --> 00:07:04.390
I am merely the
 mouthpiece of the Savior-King.

00:07:04.390 --> 00:07:07.690
That's all there is, Cesare Borgia.

00:07:10.970 --> 00:07:12.480
Oh, Caesar.

00:07:12.480 --> 00:07:14.500
He's quite the puppet.

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:17.340
I've gotten tired of him 
putting on airs with his mask.

00:07:17.340 --> 00:07:19.770
Oh, can you say that?

00:07:21.680 --> 00:07:25.010
That man is the Destroyer-King.

00:07:25.330 --> 00:07:29.450
Jeanne, Oda Nobunaga is the Destroyer-King.

00:07:31.060 --> 00:07:33.470
You are lost.

00:07:33.940 --> 00:07:35.420
Da Vinci!

00:07:35.420 --> 00:07:37.520
Y-You shouldn't sneak up on people like that.

00:07:37.690 --> 00:07:38.680
My apologies.

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:40.010
It's a bad habit of mine.

00:07:40.830 --> 00:07:44.260
You had a new vision, correct?

00:07:47.300 --> 00:07:49.770
Would you like to tell me about it?

00:07:50.120 --> 00:07:53.930
Even a wily scoundrel
 like me may be able to help.

00:07:54.800 --> 00:07:57.680
I saw and heard...

00:07:58.530 --> 00:08:00.470
That Nobunaga is the Destroyer-King.

00:08:01.470 --> 00:08:05.520
So the fact of it has
 been confirmed... has it not?

00:08:06.850 --> 00:08:07.840
No.

00:08:07.840 --> 00:08:09.050
It has not been confirmed.

00:08:09.720 --> 00:08:12.000
It's just what the prophecy chose to say.

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:13.050
I see.

00:08:13.050 --> 00:08:16.790
But I thought you had
 decided to accept the prophecy?

00:08:17.100 --> 00:08:19.290
Sure, I did.

00:08:19.700 --> 00:08:22.290
But I never said I'd just 
meekly go along with it.

00:08:23.540 --> 00:08:24.800
How interesting!

00:08:24.800 --> 00:08:27.170
So that is the path you have chosen?

00:08:27.600 --> 00:08:29.620
I will stop Nobunaga.

00:08:29.620 --> 00:08:32.170
I won't let him become the Destroyer-King.

00:08:32.840 --> 00:08:34.480
Well, out with it.

00:08:34.480 --> 00:08:36.330
That's why you came here, right?

00:08:36.330 --> 00:08:37.180
Don't be coy.

00:08:37.180 --> 00:08:38.510
Well, well.

00:08:38.510 --> 00:08:40.110
Such harsh words.

00:08:45.980 --> 00:08:48.780
Justice, reversed.

00:08:49.190 --> 00:08:50.460
Justice...

00:08:50.460 --> 00:08:53.260
Justice represents just actions,

00:08:53.260 --> 00:08:55.080
both the path one should choose

00:08:55.080 --> 00:08:56.830
and the resolve needed to follow it.

00:08:57.180 --> 00:09:02.160
But following one's heart 
is a different kind of justice.

00:09:03.710 --> 00:09:08.010
Your sense of justice is being 
questioned at this very moment.

00:09:12.890 --> 00:09:14.770
Nobu is the Destroyer-King...

00:09:19.560 --> 00:09:21.860
I am weak.

00:09:22.350 --> 00:09:24.210
Did I not swear an oath

00:09:24.210 --> 00:09:26.760
to trust Nobu, no matter what happens?

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:29.010
To become his shadow

00:09:29.010 --> 00:09:30.830
and get blood on my own hands for his sake?

00:09:31.600 --> 00:09:34.100
It's because I waver over such a thing

00:09:34.100 --> 00:09:36.110
that those I love leave me.

00:09:36.900 --> 00:09:39.020
Mitsuhide-sama, um...

00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:40.810
What is it?

00:09:43.210 --> 00:09:47.160
This may be the last time I see this tree.

00:09:47.930 --> 00:09:49.100
Ichihime-sama...

00:09:50.350 --> 00:09:54.080
And yet, I must go and see for myself.

00:10:03.790 --> 00:10:06.250
<i>She seeks an audience with Lord Caesar.</i>

00:10:06.770 --> 00:10:08.060
<i>What would you like us to do?</i>

00:10:08.790 --> 00:10:11.760
What bravery from a woman.

00:10:12.260 --> 00:10:15.110
I can smell her virtue even from here.

00:10:15.860 --> 00:10:18.850
She is definitely Caesar's type.

00:10:21.800 --> 00:10:22.920
Restrain yourselves.

00:10:23.290 --> 00:10:25.640
I am Caesar-dono's wife.

00:10:25.950 --> 00:10:28.630
Do you think such disrespect is permitted?

00:10:35.790 --> 00:10:38.340
My joy is beyond words

00:10:38.990 --> 00:10:41.340
as I see you come visit 
me of your own volition.

00:10:41.820 --> 00:10:46.340
Caesar-dono, there is 
something I must ask you.

00:10:46.580 --> 00:10:47.890
You may ask anything.

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:53.110
Caesar, what is it that you desire?

00:10:53.660 --> 00:10:56.530
An eternal, equal peace.

00:10:56.530 --> 00:10:59.220
I desire that from the bottom of my heart.

00:11:00.500 --> 00:11:03.800
I wish to love all of creation equally,

00:11:03.800 --> 00:11:06.130
including this world and you.

00:11:07.990 --> 00:11:11.940
King Arthur is capable
 of realizing such a world.

00:11:12.350 --> 00:11:14.830
That is why he is the Savior-King.

00:11:15.260 --> 00:11:18.030
I have become his instrument

00:11:18.030 --> 00:11:20.530
to change the world in his name.

00:11:21.060 --> 00:11:22.750
That is a noble purpose indeed.

00:11:23.440 --> 00:11:24.370
Yes.

00:11:24.840 --> 00:11:27.140
It is a quest more valuable than any other.

00:11:27.750 --> 00:11:29.670
Can you truly call this love of yours,

00:11:30.100 --> 00:11:34.190
which you say you will
 bestow equally upon all, true love?

00:11:34.550 --> 00:11:35.660
Of course.

00:11:44.560 --> 00:11:45.590
Ichihime-sama.

00:11:45.590 --> 00:11:46.540
Mitsuhide.

00:11:46.930 --> 00:11:48.110
Mitsuhide-sama!

00:11:48.110 --> 00:11:49.550
We can speak of this later.

00:11:49.550 --> 00:11:51.910
We will return immediately with Ichihime-sama!

00:11:52.210 --> 00:11:55.100
No, I cannot let you take Ichihime.

00:11:55.100 --> 00:11:55.680
Caesar!

00:11:56.370 --> 00:11:58.770
I wish to save Ichihime.

00:11:58.770 --> 00:12:01.920
In order to do so, I must be with her.

00:12:02.220 --> 00:12:03.510
What's does that mean?

00:12:04.010 --> 00:12:05.840
You must have realized

00:12:06.250 --> 00:12:09.690
that this world is about to end.

00:12:11.150 --> 00:12:14.200
We must manifest the
 Holy Grail before that happens.

00:12:14.580 --> 00:12:17.410
Time is too short to
 find the Chosen necessary

00:12:17.410 --> 00:12:22.940
to make the Holy Grail's 
manifestation possible.

00:12:23.580 --> 00:12:25.940
That led King Arthur to determine

00:12:26.590 --> 00:12:28.980
that he must find someone who will never die,

00:12:28.980 --> 00:12:32.940
someone who has overcome
 death itself, to serve as the Chosen.

00:12:33.220 --> 00:12:34.870
Overcome death?

00:12:36.390 --> 00:12:40.460
That is a sacred being,
 created by Cesare's team of researchers.

00:12:40.980 --> 00:12:42.300
The Perfecta.

00:12:45.420 --> 00:12:47.900
Yomotsuhirasaka is under our control,

00:12:48.360 --> 00:12:52.010
and the means to imbue a soulless 
body with life has been established.

00:12:53.010 --> 00:12:56.330
Nothing can prevent the
 Holy Grail's manifestation now.

00:12:56.330 --> 00:12:59.680
So this world can be saved as 
long as we have the Holy Grail?

00:13:00.030 --> 00:13:01.370
Indeed.

00:13:02.060 --> 00:13:04.470
After its destruction.

00:13:07.040 --> 00:13:09.310
As long as we become Perfecta,

00:13:09.310 --> 00:13:11.680
we can survive that destruction.

00:13:13.760 --> 00:13:16.040
Become an immortal Perfecta,

00:13:16.040 --> 00:13:19.190
and live in the utopia
 that King Arthur will create.

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:20.380
That's ridiculous!

00:13:20.750 --> 00:13:22.360
You are mad!

00:13:22.750 --> 00:13:25.490
You have that right, as well.

00:13:26.690 --> 00:13:29.610
King Arthur is trying to create a world

00:13:29.610 --> 00:13:32.230
of true peace where there will be no strife.

00:13:32.950 --> 00:13:35.720
A world where all can
 receive happiness in equal measure.

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:36.980
Mitsuhide,

00:13:37.660 --> 00:13:40.800
you will be happier once
 you are part of this utopia.

00:13:41.220 --> 00:13:42.480
What do you mean?

00:13:43.250 --> 00:13:46.230
Because you also love Ichihime.

00:13:48.580 --> 00:13:51.210
All will become equals and neighbors.

00:13:51.710 --> 00:13:53.740
I love Ichihime,

00:13:53.740 --> 00:13:56.500
but you can love her, as well.

00:13:57.950 --> 00:14:00.000
All shall love thy neighbor,

00:14:00.470 --> 00:14:02.890
and then the world will
 be enveloped by peace.

00:14:03.470 --> 00:14:07.240
Is there anything more wonderful?

00:14:07.530 --> 00:14:09.960
Nobu will never accept something like that.

00:14:09.960 --> 00:14:14.240
That's why I need you, Akechi Mitsuhide.

00:14:15.360 --> 00:14:19.030
If there is anyone who can 
change his mind, that is you.

00:14:19.340 --> 00:14:20.640
Let us go forth together

00:14:20.640 --> 00:14:22.700
into a world full of true love.

00:14:24.470 --> 00:14:25.680
Ichihime-sama...

00:14:26.400 --> 00:14:28.730
I see now that the Caesar-dono I know

00:14:29.620 --> 00:14:31.090
no longer exists.

00:14:31.760 --> 00:14:33.490
You give me no choice.

00:14:35.250 --> 00:14:36.360
Mitsuhide-sama!

00:14:38.550 --> 00:14:39.540
Mitsuhide!

00:14:42.260 --> 00:14:43.450
Ichihime-sama!

00:14:44.630 --> 00:14:45.710
Caesar!

00:14:48.860 --> 00:14:49.800
Mitsuhide!

00:14:49.800 --> 00:14:50.320
Chacha!

00:14:50.320 --> 00:14:51.290
Gou!

00:14:55.280 --> 00:14:56.250
Nobu!

00:14:58.090 --> 00:14:59.590
Oh, let go!

00:14:59.590 --> 00:15:02.180
I will go help my betrothed, too!

00:15:02.180 --> 00:15:03.160
No!

00:15:03.160 --> 00:15:05.100
I can't let you go right now!

00:15:07.050 --> 00:15:09.350
Now that I'm half machine, I can feel things.

00:15:09.670 --> 00:15:11.870
You're pushing yourself too hard, aren't you?

00:15:12.760 --> 00:15:14.110
You...

00:15:14.880 --> 00:15:17.760
You saved my life.

00:15:18.660 --> 00:15:20.880
I can't just let you throw your life away.

00:15:21.110 --> 00:15:25.030
It is foolish to fight... but if I must.

00:15:25.750 --> 00:15:27.180
Of course.

00:15:27.180 --> 00:15:30.130
There is no other way to 
deal with who you've become!

00:15:42.540 --> 00:15:44.240
Your skills have improved...

00:15:44.240 --> 00:15:47.450
And yours have not dulled.

00:15:47.450 --> 00:15:48.570
But!

00:15:54.010 --> 00:15:55.160
Ichihime-sama!

00:15:55.160 --> 00:15:57.090
Nobu, Ichihime-sama is inside!

00:16:01.710 --> 00:16:03.190
The Dragon of Destruction...

00:16:03.450 --> 00:16:06.830
I see you will resist until 
the very end, Destroyer-King!

00:16:08.380 --> 00:16:09.200
Of course.

00:16:11.970 --> 00:16:14.340
Why won't you try to understand?!

00:16:14.790 --> 00:16:17.170
Why won't you believe in love?!

00:16:19.810 --> 00:16:22.180
A world where everyone 
loved each other, equally,

00:16:22.180 --> 00:16:24.950
would be a world of true happiness!

00:16:25.180 --> 00:16:27.180
What do you mean equal love?!

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:32.320
The very idea of such
 a world makes me sick!

00:16:36.490 --> 00:16:37.690
Ichihime-sama!

00:16:38.270 --> 00:16:39.440
You...

00:16:39.440 --> 00:16:41.610
Please stop, Caesar.

00:16:41.900 --> 00:16:44.490
Right now, you cannot best my brother.

00:16:44.490 --> 00:16:48.270
Even so, I cannot concede defeat.

00:16:48.270 --> 00:16:50.710
Who will protect you, then?

00:16:52.000 --> 00:16:54.180
I want to save you.

00:16:54.850 --> 00:16:56.400
In order to save you,

00:16:56.400 --> 00:16:59.720
my only choice is to wager on
 the world King Arthur will create!

00:16:59.720 --> 00:17:00.870
Caesar...

00:17:01.180 --> 00:17:03.090
You are a fool.

00:17:03.720 --> 00:17:04.630
Why

00:17:05.210 --> 00:17:06.720
won't you understand?

00:17:07.430 --> 00:17:09.090
<i>Poor Lady Ichihime.</i>

00:17:09.090 --> 00:17:12.230
<i>You're too obsessed with the idea of living.</i>

00:17:12.580 --> 00:17:16.210
<i>You're being held back by those around you,</i>

00:17:16.210 --> 00:17:18.230
<i>bound by the curse of life.</i>

00:17:18.500 --> 00:17:20.000
The curse of life?

00:17:20.310 --> 00:17:22.800
<i>To liberate Lady Ichihime,</i>

00:17:22.800 --> 00:17:26.740
<i>we may need to cut away 
everything that's holding her back.</i>

00:17:29.640 --> 00:17:31.560
Rot in hell,

00:17:31.560 --> 00:17:33.750
Gaius Julius Caesar.

00:17:34.230 --> 00:17:35.940
Everything that's holding her back...

00:17:46.730 --> 00:17:50.380
Ichihime, I will liberate you...

00:17:50.380 --> 00:17:53.940
from this temporal life that
 has bound you in its chains!

00:18:03.550 --> 00:18:04.410
You wouldn't!

00:18:11.130 --> 00:18:12.220
I won't let you!

00:18:12.220 --> 00:18:13.850
I will cut you down before you fire!

00:18:15.020 --> 00:18:16.420
It's futile.

00:18:16.420 --> 00:18:18.660
As long as I have Excalibur here,

00:18:18.660 --> 00:18:21.830
not even the Dragon of 
Destruction may come near me!

00:18:22.210 --> 00:18:23.240
What can we do?!

00:18:27.860 --> 00:18:30.360
If that is the power of the Regalia...

00:18:30.640 --> 00:18:32.340
there can be only one course of action.

00:18:32.340 --> 00:18:33.410
You can't mean...

00:18:33.790 --> 00:18:35.610
I will kill its wielder!

00:18:37.670 --> 00:18:38.610
Ichihime!

00:18:39.110 --> 00:18:41.680
Brother, you must not hesitate!

00:18:41.920 --> 00:18:42.950
Ichi...

00:18:42.950 --> 00:18:46.910
You will unite heaven and earth some day.

00:18:47.340 --> 00:18:51.690
Then you must not be swayed
 by the gravity of your destiny!

00:18:56.370 --> 00:18:58.690
Ichihime, why?!

00:19:02.180 --> 00:19:04.210
Well said, Ichi!

00:19:04.210 --> 00:19:05.530
Don't, Nobu!

00:19:05.530 --> 00:19:09.100
Ichihime-sama is in there!

00:19:09.960 --> 00:19:10.980
I won't let you!

00:19:12.600 --> 00:19:16.210
I've made up my mind not to let 
you become the Destroyer-King!

00:19:16.210 --> 00:19:17.720
I can't let you kill your sister!

00:19:17.720 --> 00:19:18.650
Out of the way!

00:19:20.360 --> 00:19:21.480
I...

00:19:22.020 --> 00:19:25.740
I must save you, no matter what the cost!

00:19:25.740 --> 00:19:27.500
At least you, Ichihime!

00:19:27.690 --> 00:19:29.380
Caesar-dono...

00:19:29.720 --> 00:19:31.430
Because I love you!

00:19:31.940 --> 00:19:33.350
With all my soul!

00:19:34.500 --> 00:19:36.280
Do you speak the truth?

00:19:36.280 --> 00:19:38.110
So much for equal love.

00:19:38.580 --> 00:19:42.510
You're smothering Ichi
 with your obsessive love.

00:19:43.430 --> 00:19:46.010
But there's nothing wrong with that!

00:19:46.010 --> 00:19:46.880
No!

00:19:47.120 --> 00:19:49.150
Don't do it, Nobunaga!

00:19:59.840 --> 00:20:01.310
I...

00:20:06.370 --> 00:20:11.010
I've cut down the nefarious
 shade that is manipulating you!

00:20:11.470 --> 00:20:12.650
Destroyer-King!

00:20:15.440 --> 00:20:19.160
What was I... about to do to Nobu?

00:20:21.650 --> 00:20:25.890
I couldn't trust Nobunaga.

00:20:35.940 --> 00:20:37.260
Ichihime...

00:20:37.260 --> 00:20:40.440
We finally meet again, Caesar-dono.

00:20:41.080 --> 00:20:41.980
Yes...

00:20:41.980 --> 00:20:43.160
Ichihime,

00:20:43.730 --> 00:20:46.120
I have wished to see you again.

00:20:51.450 --> 00:20:52.550
Do it.

00:20:52.740 --> 00:20:53.550
Run!

00:20:53.730 --> 00:20:54.700
Blood!

00:20:54.700 --> 00:20:55.920
Show us more blood!

00:20:56.620 --> 00:20:58.420
What are you—

00:20:58.420 --> 00:20:59.320
Show us...

00:20:59.840 --> 00:21:01.620
your beautiful scarlet blood!

00:21:04.670 --> 00:21:06.390
Nel...

00:21:08.140 --> 00:21:10.610
That was completely unnecessary.

00:21:10.610 --> 00:21:13.600
What a disappointment you are, Caesar!

00:21:17.570 --> 00:21:19.440
Oh, it <i>hurts</i>...

00:21:20.200 --> 00:21:21.470
Ichihime!

00:21:21.470 --> 00:21:22.620
Ichi!

00:21:24.100 --> 00:21:25.840
Cae... sar...

00:21:33.860 --> 00:21:35.130
Ichihime...

00:21:36.500 --> 00:21:40.070
Ah, I finally see it now.

00:21:41.080 --> 00:21:43.920
The happiness I desired

00:21:44.990 --> 00:21:48.860
was precious time, spent with the one I love.

00:21:50.410 --> 00:21:52.040
What tragedy.

00:21:52.470 --> 00:21:53.710
I... had...

00:21:54.430 --> 00:21:56.710
already obtained it...

00:22:03.230 --> 00:22:04.990
Nobu...

00:22:06.080 --> 00:22:08.240
I was happy in life...

00:22:09.330 --> 00:22:12.600
Able to walk my own 
path until the very end.

00:22:13.800 --> 00:22:20.020
Nobu, you can bring... happiness...

00:22:22.140 --> 00:22:23.960
and true peace to all.

00:22:23.960 --> 00:22:27.680
So trust in your path...

00:22:28.290 --> 00:22:29.560
Until the very... end.

00:24:11.410 --> 00:24:14.350
Lies, farce, and nonsense.

00:24:14.680 --> 00:24:16.830
Death haunts Nobu.

00:24:16.830 --> 00:24:18.720
Those whose lives I've taken...

00:24:19.230 --> 00:24:21.020
Next time: The Devil.

00:24:21.560 --> 00:24:22.810
Ichihime-sama.

00:24:22.810 --> 00:24:25.260
I will never forget your spirit.
